+/-- `option::Iter<'a, A> { inner: Item<&'a A> }` with `Item<A> { opt: Option<A> }`
+    (core/src/option.rs). Its `Iterator` impl defines only `next`
+    (`self.opt.take()`) and the exact `size_hint` `(len, Some(len))`; it is
+    `TrustedLen`, `FusedIterator` and flatten's `OneShot`, and not
+    `TrustedRandomAccess`. -/
