+(** Lay out the region parameters of every method as those of its trait (or
+    implementation) followed by its own.
+
+    This is how Charon lays out the parameters of methods, except for the
+    methods specialized by its partial monomorphization ([--monomorphize-mut]):
+    the regions extracted from the specialized arguments are appended after the
